  "reasoning": "The defendant bought two firearms, sold one to another person, kept one for personal use, and lent one to a convicted robber. Police later recovered the disassembled parts, reassembled them into two functional firearms, which were identified as self‑made guns with lethal capability. These facts demonstrate illegal acquisition, sale, and possession of firearms. According to Chinese criminal law, such conduct constitutes illegal buying/selling of firearms and illegal possession (including private storage) of firearms (and any associated ammunition or components). No evidence of manufacturing by the defendant is present, so the charge of illegal manufacturing is not applied. Therefore the appropriate charges are illegal buying/selling of firearms and illegal possession/private storage of firearms (and ammunition).",
